# Nothing stateful or secret under infra/tofu/ is ever committed. State and
# tfvars stay in the owner's checkout (see root.hcl).

# Provider caches and terragrunt working dirs. Regenerable with `tofu init`.
**/.terraform/
**/.terragrunt-cache/
# Providers are pinned exactly in each unit's _providers.tf; the lock file is
# regenerated locally.
**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Backend config generated by root.hcl.
**/backend.tf

# Plan artifacts.
**/planfile

# State and variables.
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example
